COMMENT
SP19 focused ON coverage: two stands in one run (stand resets), the fire,
fuel, snag, down-wood, carbon, burn and mortality reports, MCDEFECT and a
valid VOLEQNUM.
END

STDIDENT
ONFire

ECHOSUM

DATABASE
DSNin
FVSDataHardwood.db
StandSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_StandInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
TreeSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_TreeInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
End

TIMEINT                      5
NUMCYCLE           6

MCDEFECT                    MH       10.       20.       30.       40.       50.
VOLEQNUM          MH900CLKE318

FMIN
POTFIRE
FUELOUT
SNAGOUT
SNAGSUM
DWDVLOUT
DWDCVOUT
CARBREPT
MORTREPT
BURNREPT
SIMFIRE         2014
END

TREELIST           0
DATABASE
DSNOut
ONFocused.db
Summary
TreeLiDB           2
END

PROCESS

STDIDENT
ONThin

ECHOSUM

DATABASE
DSNin
FVSDataHardwood.db
StandSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_StandInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
TreeSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_TreeInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'LD3001'
EndSQL
End

TIMEINT                      5
NUMCYCLE           6
THINBBA         2014        15
CUTLIST            0
TREELIST           0

DATABASE
DSNOut
ONFocused.db
Summary
CutLiDB            2
TreeLiDB           2
END

PROCESS
STOP
